"description":"Record, Podcast, Listen \n\nSince 2003, StoryCorps’ commitment to recording local stories, creating award-winning content, and helping illuminate the humanity in each of us has contributed to nearly 700,000 people across the country having meaningful conversations. Get involved by downloading the App today! Here are some of the features to look forward to:\n\n\n\n- Listen to StoryCorps’ podcast and watch animations all in one place.\n- Record conversations in the App or upload an existing audio file to your account.\n- Join an initiative, including Brightness In Black, One Small Step DIY, Military Voices Initiative, or The Great Listen.\n- Prepare interview questions or use our pre-populated ones.\n- Search our Online Archive for conversations about the themes important to you.\n\n\nListen, honor, and share with the StoryCorps App. Major support for the StoryCorps App made possible by Jane Phillips Donaldson & William H. Donaldson. \n\n\nFor more information about the StoryCorps App, visit storycorps.org/app.", "languageCodesISO2A":["EN"], "fileSizeBytes":"54348800", "formattedPrice":"Free", "userRatingCountForCurrentVersion":1594, "trackContentRating":"4+", "sellerUrl":"https://archive.storycorps.org/", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.63863000000000003097966327914036810398101806640625, "bundleId":"com.bottlerocketapps.storycorps", "minimumOsVersion":"15.1", "userRatingCount":1594}]
